  "sourceTitle": "Mushroom Burger Patties",
  "sourceText": "Mushroom Burger Patties\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, December 24, 2009 - 11:13pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 pound ground beef\n1 teaspoon salt\n1 (4 oz.) can mushroom pieces\n1 egg\n1/4 teaspoon Worcestershire sauce\n1/4 cup chopped onion\n1 tablespoon shortening\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Preheat fry pan at 350 degrees. Combine beef, mushrooms, onion, egg, salt, pepper and Worcestershire sauce. Shape into patties. Melt shortening and fry patties on both sides until done.",
